  "caption": "Malay cinematic folk-rock with a French-pop melodic lilt. Fingerpicked nylon-string acoustic guitar, brushed drums in a gentle waltz-tinged swing, walking upright bass, wheezing accordion countermelody, a soft string quartet rising in the chorus. Vintage room sound with light tape warmth. Male baritone, warm close croon with a slight smile in the voice. 92 BPM, F major. Wry, fond and quietly amused. No autotune, no trap drums, no power ballad drums, no electric guitar solo, no synth pads.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - nylon guitar and accordion]\n\n[Verse 1]\nIsnin dia datang lagi\nBaju Melayu hijau pucuk\nButang kedua dah tak masuk\nEncik, saya tak makan apa pun\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAku buka jahitan tepi\nAku tak tanya, aku senyum\n\n[Chorus]\nBaju yang sama\nMinggu ini lepas seinci\nKampung Baru bau murtabak\nRaya tinggal lapan hari\n\n[Verse 2]\nIsnin lagi, dia tunduk\nBawa kuih untuk aku\nKain lebih makin sikit\nDia tanya, masih boleh ke\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAku ukur pinggang dia\nPita aku dah tak cukup\n\n[Chorus]\nBaju yang sama\nKali terakhir, aku kata\nPagi Raya dia lambai dari surau\nButang semua masih ada\n\n[Outro - strings and accordion, guitar last chord]",
